[00:41.54]I wrote a song 'bout being weak
[00:41.54]我写过歌 关于脆弱的一首歌
[00:45.86]Now I hear congratulations
[00:45.86]如今耳边尽是祝贺
[00:48.61]They know me in L.A. now it seems
[00:48.61]在洛杉矶似乎已小有名气
[00:51.86]Today I finally get to leave
[00:51.86]今天终于能离开
[00:56.14]Leave this little life I'm used to
[00:56.14]离开这习以为常的渺小生活
[00:59.05]The shows that no one came to
[00:59.05]那些无人问津的演出
[01:01.63]They're shrinking in my rearview
[01:01.63]正在后视镜里渐渐缩小
[01:04.24]And I should be so happy I could cry
[01:04.24]我本该喜极而泣
